  "implemented": [
    "Reserve retained common-handle targets before minting IMAGEDEF, IMAGE and reactor identities within the existing outer compound checkpoint.",
    "Append the generated reactor to the copied definition's retained independent reactor vector before encoding its count/header and payload.",
    "Reject null/duplicate retained definition reactors, a definition list without room for its new child, excessive reactor lists and unsupported DataStorage state.",
    "Validate available, valid, matching-object/version, nonzero and distinct-generation receipts for all three frames.",
    "Publish caller IMAGE fields only after complete success; retain the outer boundary for public rollback of all three frames and class-instance effects.",
    "Make existing-reference IMAGE writes succeed without companions; retain compact native rollback and restore writer failure flags for corrected retries.",
    "Unwind a thrown receipt before facade transaction publication; preserve a full fallback for unknown writers without compact rollback.",
    "Add a dedicated fast transaction selector and strengthen public source readback/identity checks across all six supported native write revisions.",
    "Update the active plan and consumer contract; leave source-profile and support-claim gates unchanged."
  ],
